{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 26, :comments ["And He said — to His angels." "Let us make man — as we find in the case of Micaiah son of Imlah in Kings, and in Isaiah: ״את מי אשלח ומי ילך לנו״, and also in Job." "In our likeness — in the matter of our wisdom, for when a person degenerates it is written: ״נמשל כבהמות נדמו״." "And they shall rule — from רדה, as ויעשו is from עשה, ויבכו from בכה, וישבו from שבה."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T23:17:31.035064652Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}